https://leetcode.com/problems/next-permutation/description/

Algorithm:
Find the pivot: Traverse from right to left and find the first index i where nums[i] < nums[i + 1].

Find the successor: If a pivot exists, traverse from right to left and find the first element greater than nums[i]. Swap them.

Reverse the suffix: Reverse the subarray from i + 1 to the end to get the smallest possible suffix.

If no pivot exists, reverse the entire array.
